<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.African money mkt shortage 10.05 bln rand Wed.</title>
<headline>S.African money mkt shortage 10.05 bln rand Wed.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's money market shortage fell to 10.048 billion rand on Wednesday from 10.664 billion rand on Tuesday, the Reserve Bank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
